WEBVTT

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:12.950
Appeared in front of me...

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:18.010
That girl was one
of the first students...

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:23.130
I ever had as a kyoshi.

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:26.380
And there was me.
My heart pounding ever faster.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.470
But because we were both women...

00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:30.810
I thought this pounding...

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:34.640
I thought it was something different...

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:37.780
And there was me, becoming attracted
to her without even realizing.

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:41.960
But we were kyoshi and student,
woman and woman.

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:45.070
And besides she was 14.

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:49.150
I kept refusing to admit it...

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:51.660
But it wasn't.

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:56.250
I loved that person.

00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:59.000
No matter what others
might have thought.

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:03.790
But then...

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:08.050
Amawa-sensei here is a male!

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:11.830
This shameful sight!

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:18.900
I chose the path
I had to as a kyoshi.

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.020
That person was a man.

00:01:27.510 --> 00:01:29.740
Not only that, he was...

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:35.460
The woman and man
are the same person.

00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:38.860
But my feelings for her
aren't the same as for him.

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:45.670
Was the whole thing nothing but ...

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:45.670
Was the whole thing nothing but a lie.

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:47.420
It was the right thing to do.

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:51.740
The feeling towards her,
I can just ignore.

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:55.160
Because...

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:59.950
Because I'm a kyoshi...

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:05.460
I, My, Me! - Strawberry-eggs

00:02:05.460 --> 00:02:10.110
13th Period
Someday,
Without Makeup as Promised

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:13.040
Yes, the kyoshi in question
has already been dismissed!

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:14.210
We are sorry!

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:16.120
No one had ever dreamed it was a man!

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:19.080
There is a school
assembly scheduled, and...

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:21.650
We're receiving an
incessant stream of calls...

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:24.620
from angered and concerned parents
about Hibiki Amawa being...

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:26.830
a cross-dressing man.

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:28.070
Of course we are.

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:31.070
It was exactly something
a man would do.

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:34.830
To think we entrusted our pure
female students to such a beast.

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:37.600
How dreadful.
How shameful!

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:39.390
Men are all devils!

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:41.300
Principal!

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:42.980
Are you alright?

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:44.620
Please be assured.

00:02:44.650 --> 00:02:48.130
The motion to convert this
school to a girls-only facility...

00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:50.890
will be adopted unanimously
at the assembly tomorrow.

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:53.710
Neither students, nor
parents should oppose it.

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:55.820
Thanks to Hibiki Amawa.

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:58.830
The next PE

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:58.830
class is swimming!

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:58.550
It's such a letdown.

00:02:58.790 --> 00:03:00.710
I thought she was a good sensei.

00:03:00.710 --> 00:03:02.470
To think he was a mere pervert.

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:04.830
We've let him have a lot
of fun without us knowing it.

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:05.580
Oh no!

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:06.420
He saw us change!

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:08.250
He was also using
the ladies bathroom.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.680
He came to the girls'
dorm as well, didn't he?

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:14.830
That is right!

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:17.230
And Fuko-san slept in the same bed...

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:20.350
He already had Fuko
as a target back then.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:21.350
Target...

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:26.610
Men are dirty-minded
through and through.

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:30.080
Maybe I should re-consider
going out with them.

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:31.150
News! News!

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:34.670
I heard tomorrow's
assembly is about...

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:37.150
whether to turn this
place into a "girls' school".

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:38.790
What do you mean?

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:41.040
Because of that cross-dressing kyoshi.

00:03:43.770 --> 00:03:45.550
For the Principal and Vice-Principal...

00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:48.160
it's a perfect opportunity
to eliminate us men.

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:50.500
Are we going to be
kicked out of school, then?

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:53.300
They just won't accept
any men starting next year.

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:56.480
But, this year they're going to
encourage voluntary withdrawal.

00:03:56.780 --> 00:04:00.660
After all this, I'll feel better
having a male-free environment.

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:03.440
Humph, we'll happily
leave a school like this.

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:06.430
I'm sick of looking
at you girls' faces.

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:07.550
How rude!

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:10.020
The next PE

00:04:12.570 --> 00:04:14.460
Dirty cross-dressing kyoshi!

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:27.910
You're really leaving.

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:29.270
Yes, tomorrow.

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:31.420
But it's too bad.

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:33.280
I really wish you
had let me join you.

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:34.470
Yeah, me too.

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:35.710
Join me do what?

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:37.010
Oh, come on.

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:40.670
We know you dressed as a woman
and went to school with Fuko-chan.

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:42.910
It was a wonderful idea.

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:46.680
I wish I could've looked at the school
uniforms up close to my heart's content.

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:50.850
Excuse me, but it wasn't to get
close to uniforms or female students.

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:56.190
It was effectively
the same thing, I guess.

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:57.300
Yes, yes.

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:01.010
You two finished
the cleaning, I presume?

00:05:04.850 --> 00:05:06.570
Do you have a place to go?

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:08.180
Well, I'll be OK.

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:09.340
Got money?

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:12.010
I'll be OK with that, too.

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:13.560
That's stupid.

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:16.340
Why don't you get your
last pay from school?

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:18.660
No way. I can't do that.

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:22.030
No matter how you looked,
you were working there.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.100
Well, but then again...

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:27.520
I don't know what they'd do to
you if you went there right now.

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:30.350
It seems you're a big hit there.

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:32.060
I don't doubt it.

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:34.550
How about the students in your class?

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:37.660
The same, I'd say.

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:39.070
Besides...

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:41.080
it's better that way.

00:05:52.390 --> 00:05:53.020
Let's go!

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:53.590
Yeah.

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:09.380
Fuko, don't look.

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:12.170
It's the pervert in his
true form, Bra-Man.

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:16.670
Honestly, a kyoshi
deceiving students...

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:18.690
Disgusting.

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:26.590
So...

00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:32.350
was the whole thing
nothing but a lie?

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:35.330
Was there no such Sensei
named Hibiki Amawa?

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:40.710
Yeah, I just needed a job because
I didn't have any money.

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:43.130
Sorry. Just forget it.

00:06:44.310 --> 00:06:47.620
I'm ashamed of myself for thinking
a person like you was my sensei!

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.590
Fuko, let's go.

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:59.500
Heck, no wonder men's
reputation has been ruined.

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:02.230
This is what I call disillusionment.

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:03.760
Not even worth punching.

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:23.750
Gochiso

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:29.810
Begging your pardon.

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:32.010
Oh, you are that Gochiso's...

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:33.720
What brings you here?

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:37.010
My tenant says he hasn't been paid.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:38.670
So I came to get it on his behalf.

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:40.140
Hasn't been paid?

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:41.290
How presumptuous.

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:43.730
That man slipped in
under false pretenses.

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:45.690
But you're the one
who didn't realize it.

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:49.860
Why don't you just pay him?
He's leaving without a fuss.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:51.070
Very well.

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:53.390
If it will stop these uninvited calls.

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:57.130
But you're a hard-core
man-hater, aren't you?

00:07:57.420 --> 00:07:59.280
Must've had a terrible experience.

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:01.940
What business is it of yours?

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:03.580
It's too bad.

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:07.580
I thought if anyone could
crack your shell, it'd be him.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:09.280
But I guess I was wrong.

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:16.150
Is anything the matter, Principal?

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:18.190
If I'm not mistaken, that was...

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:20.890
No, it was nothing.

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:23.560
How's tomorrow's
assembly preparation coming?

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:25.020
Yes, everything is set.

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:28.820
The Director should be the lone
voice of opposition to the conversion.

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:31.580
Three years from now, at the latest...

00:08:31.580 --> 00:08:33.980
there will be no males
whatsoever in this school.

00:08:40.590 --> 00:08:42.040
Cheers!

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:44.800
Good

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:44.800
bye,

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:44.800
Hibiki

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:44.800
Amawa-kun

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:44.800
Good-bye, Hibiki Amawa-kun

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:44.740
Thank you very much.

00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:50.100
Come back here
if things get too tough.

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:54.810
Ah, this is a farewell gift for you.
A limited edition.

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:57.670
And a doll from Kochi.

00:08:57.750 --> 00:08:58.450
Thanks...

00:08:58.800 --> 00:08:58.850
Sake

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:19.340
I hear Sannomiya Private School
is becoming a girls' school.

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:25.550
It's none of my business now.

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:28.780
But it concerns your students.

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:32.090
To them, I'm not their
kyoshi or anything at all.

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:36.510
The female Hibiki Amawa
was a fake kyoshi.

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:37.710
A fake, huh?

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:40.980
So that means what
you've been teaching them...

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:42.770
for the past few months
is also all fake.

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:49.010
What about Fuko Kuzuha?

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:52.590
What are you saying, Ba-chan?!
I'm a kyoshi, that's why!

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:58.060
I shouldn't be around
that girl any longer.

00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:01.250
A fake one moment
and a kyoshi the next.

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:02.970
What a busy man you are.

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:49.080
A big deal, isn't it?
The school assembly.

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:50.800
Although the result is obvious.

00:10:57.450 --> 00:10:59.000
Let us begin...

00:10:59.150 --> 00:11:02.020
the school assembly now.

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:11.870
For those reasons...

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:14.980
it is our belief that this school
should become a girls-only facility.

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:17.310
However, we do not plan
to decide solely among...

00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:19.720
the Principal, Director
and faculty members.

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:24.910
We'd like to obtain the students'
and family members' consent today.

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:27.080
Who's going to oppose?

00:11:27.230 --> 00:11:30.370
The only thing is, with the boys gone,
who's gonna do the cleaning?

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:31.450
Ume!

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:34.350
You've been looking at us as
nothing but cleaning crew?!

00:11:34.470 --> 00:11:36.410
What, didn't you know?

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:40.300
Ah, if Hibiki-chan was here, she
would've helped us with the cleaning.

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:46.660
Hey, that hurt!

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:47.260
Watch it.

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:58.690
We shall take a vote
on the subject now.

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:01.140
But upon deciding the matter...

00:12:01.140 --> 00:12:05.260
we'd like you, the family members,
to see Hibiki Amawa's true identity.

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:18.860
See you, Kura-Ge.

00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:22.130
I'll come get you,
when I find a place to live.

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:24.240
Don't become dog-stew
before that, OK?

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:36.900
Gochiso

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:42.030
For Dog-Stew

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:49.420
This is not the only crime
that this man committed.

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:53.040
Making our female students wear
buruma to satisfy his taste.

00:12:53.070 --> 00:12:54.420
He is quite a savage...

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:56.320
shameless, lying, false kyoshi!

00:12:56.470 --> 00:12:58.800
A symbol of male stupidity!

00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:06.600
Now, if you're opposed
to the conversion of Seitow...

00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:08.820
Sannomiya Private School
into an all girls school...

00:13:08.820 --> 00:13:10.060
please stand up.

00:13:16.490 --> 00:13:17.240
Well.

00:13:17.240 --> 00:13:20.720
Excuse me, but I believe
you are not a family member.

00:13:21.020 --> 00:13:22.730
I'm that man's deputy.

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:27.400
There's no way he would've
agreed to such a stupid idea.

00:13:29.180 --> 00:13:31.340
A deputy? For such a man?

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:37.280
It's true he was a fake as a woman,
but how about as a kyoshi, I wonder?

00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:00.660
Now dive!!

00:14:09.720 --> 00:14:11.930
Fuko Kuzuha!
What are you doing?

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:12.940
What happened?!

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:15.700
That time...

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:19.570
That moment couldn't
have been a lie.

00:14:24.520 --> 00:14:25.050
Kuzuha...

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:30.970
What, what are you doing?

00:14:36.670 --> 00:14:37.860
Hibiki-sensei...

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:45.910
Hibiki-sensei helped me
run 50 meters without falling...

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:48.030
for the first time in my life.

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:53.910
I have no idea

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:53.910
Hibiki-sensei shared
our problems with us.

00:14:57.470 --> 00:15:01.070
Hibiki-sensei helped the boys
with the cleaning duties.

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:07.900
Hibiki-sensei did the
parent-school visit with us.

00:15:11.580 --> 00:15:13.750
Hibiki-sensei became angry for us.

00:15:13.780 --> 00:15:15.920
Hibiki-sensei protected us.

00:15:16.710 --> 00:15:18.010
Hibiki-sensei...

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:20.380
fought for us.

00:15:20.720 --> 00:15:22.300
Fuko Kuzuha!

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:23.440
Cut it out!

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:24.560
Hibiki-sensei...

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:27.180
Hibiki-sensei believed in us.

00:15:27.180 --> 00:15:29.140
Sensei is not a fake!

00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:30.450
It wasn't a deception!

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:33.710
I still...

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:37.760
love Sensei.

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:41.030
Cut it out! Let go!!

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:49.060
What?

00:15:51.940 --> 00:15:53.970
I see. You oppose.

00:15:54.270 --> 00:15:56.720
However, the overwhelming
majority is...

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:07.120
Sensei, we're sorry!!

00:16:07.880 --> 00:16:10.690
We had forgotten about the
times we'd shared with you!

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:13.780
It doesn't matter if you
are a man or a woman!

00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:15.380
Hibiki-chan!

00:16:17.380 --> 00:16:19.530
Come back!!

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:25.790
Sensei! Sensei!
Sensei! Sensei!

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:32.890
Sensei! Sensei!

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:34.360
Guards!

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:42.190
Miho-chan! Fujio-chan!

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:43.270
Fuko!

00:16:47.880 --> 00:16:48.590
Everyone.

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:51.530
Thank you.

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:57.540
For calling me "Sensei" again.
Thank you.

00:16:57.600 --> 00:16:59.790
Hibiki-sensei?
Hibiki-sensei!

00:16:59.840 --> 00:17:00.620
Where?!

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:02.630
Hibiki-chan!

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:06.710
Hey, stop!

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:08.960
I'm sorry for lying to you.

00:17:09.520 --> 00:17:12.180
But I really loved you all.

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:22.340
Himejima, Aoki, Fukae, Iwaya, Ohmono,
Fukushima, Deyashiki, Ashiya...

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:23.860
Outside, go to the rooftop!

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:31.570
Nishinada, Noda, Yodogawa, Ohishi,
Naruo, Shinzaike, Amagasaki, Mikage...

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:36.460
Manase, Uozaki,
Kasuganomichi, Umeda...

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:37.770
and Kuzuha.

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:38.790
Thank you.

00:17:38.920 --> 00:17:39.840
Over there!

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:41.370
Sensei!

00:17:41.630 --> 00:17:43.830
We opposed the conversion
to the girls' school!

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:45.690
Come back!

00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:51.420
But I think I should
leave here, for now.

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:54.260
Kyoshi and students,
males and females...

00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:55.970
we're all the same human beings.

00:17:55.970 --> 00:18:00.230
Yet certain feelings arise
because we're not the same...

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:03.720
and there are too many questions
I don't have the answers to.

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:07.230
I'll be ashamed of myself if I don't
do anything to find out these answers.

00:18:08.590 --> 00:18:10.330
So I've decided. Someday...

00:18:11.260 --> 00:18:12.460
I'll be back.

00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:15.340
After I train myself enough...

00:18:15.550 --> 00:18:18.380
so that my true self deserves
to be called "Sensei" by you.

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:27.220
Thank you all.

00:18:28.650 --> 00:18:30.840
I'm truly glad I became a kyoshi.

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:43.970
Kuzuha.

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:48.900
Sensei!
Hibiki-sensei!

00:18:49.110 --> 00:18:50.550
Hibiki-sensei!

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:54.700
Sensei!!

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:56.950
Hibiki-sensei!!

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:00.200
Fuko, let's go!

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:03.750
We can catch up if we run!

00:19:13.150 --> 00:19:14.220
We should go, too!

00:19:14.300 --> 00:19:15.190
Yeah!

00:19:21.100 --> 00:19:27.530
A blue sky before the end of the rainy season

00:19:21.100 --> 00:19:27.530
Tsuyu ake mae no aozora wa...

00:19:27.940 --> 00:19:35.450
makes a heart dance with expectation

00:19:27.940 --> 00:19:35.450
hitoashi hayaku kokoro wo odoraseru

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:42.920
Summer is coming yet again

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:42.920
Kotoshi mo mosugu natsuga kuru

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:51.340
The city and people are coming to life bursting with joy

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:51.340
Machi mo hito mo ukare kibun de zawameki dasu

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:51.230
Sensei!

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:52.660
Darn, we were too late.

00:19:52.930 --> 00:20:07.700
Watashi wa to ieba, anata wo omoi
Kono machi de atarashii kaze ni fukarete

00:19:52.930 --> 00:20:07.700
Me? I'm thinking of you in this
new city where unfamiliar winds blow

00:19:57.780 --> 00:19:59.230
Please let us borrow your bike!

00:20:08.730 --> 00:20:15.480
Sukoshi no fuan mo, dakishime nagara

00:20:08.730 --> 00:20:15.480
Embracing a little bit of insecurity

00:20:16.180 --> 00:20:23.140
Kanaetai ashita dake wo, mitsumete ikiru

00:20:16.180 --> 00:20:23.140
Yet looking only to tomorrow
to make my dreams come true

00:20:24.630 --> 00:20:32.340
Me? I'm thinking of you in this
new city where unfamiliar winds blow

00:20:24.630 --> 00:20:32.340
Shonen no kokoro no mama otona ni natta hito

00:20:32.930 --> 00:20:40.500
We can't go back to the day we met for the first time, but...

00:20:32.930 --> 00:20:41.550
Futari deatta anohi ni modorenai kedo...

00:20:40.350 --> 00:20:41.120
Fukae-kun!

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:42.970
Kuzuha! Run!

00:20:43.150 --> 00:20:50.780
If I close my eyes, I can see your smiling face

00:20:43.150 --> 00:20:50.780
Hitomi wo tojireba hohoemu kao ga mieru

00:20:45.350 --> 00:20:46.670
Run! Kuzuha!

00:20:50.900 --> 00:20:58.670
The song we both loved. Do you still sing it?

00:20:50.900 --> 00:20:58.670
Daisuki na ano uta. Ima mo utatte masuka?

00:20:58.670 --> 00:21:06.510
I can still hear that gentle voice and melody

00:20:58.670 --> 00:21:06.510
Watashi ni wa kikoeru. Yasashii koe to melody

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:15.810
During times of sadness, I will remember you

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:15.810
Yowaki na toki hodo anata wo omoidasu

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:26.990
As time passed, I began to hate myself

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:26.990
Tokiori jibun ga, kirai ni naru no wa

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:35.020
When I hurt someone, with thoughtless words

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:35.020
Karu hazumi na kotoba de dare ka wo kizutsuke

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:42.470
That habit of weakness, for any small reason

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:42.470
Sono kuse yowakute, chippoke dakara

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:50.410
Please tell me to be strong

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:50.410
Nigeyouto suru watashi wo shikatte kudasai

00:21:51.960 --> 00:21:59.840
Singing softly to myself
the melody we had sung together

00:21:51.960 --> 00:21:59.840
Futari de utatta melody, kuchi zusande mireba

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:08.670
Made me shed a tear and long to see you

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:08.670
Namida hitotsuji nagarete, aitakunatta

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:11.530
The last male kyoshi in our
school long ago was like him.

00:22:10.360 --> 00:22:17.950
I can still hear that gentle voice and melody

00:22:10.360 --> 00:22:17.950
Watashi ni wa kikoeru. Yasashii koe to melody

00:22:11.530 --> 00:22:14.800
The one who abandoned
you and left the school.

00:22:15.190 --> 00:22:16.440
How do you know?

00:22:17.140 --> 00:22:19.010
Men are capable of love as well.

00:22:17.950 --> 00:22:26.860
During times of sadness, I will remember you

00:22:17.950 --> 00:22:26.860
Yowaki na toki hodo anata wo omoidasu

00:22:19.260 --> 00:22:24.470
Who's to say he hasn't been watching
over you all these years in a disguise?

00:22:25.570 --> 00:22:26.340
It can't be...

00:22:27.820 --> 00:22:36.020
You played the guitar over the phone, just for me

00:22:27.820 --> 00:22:36.020
Juwaki goshi ni guitar, kiite kikasete kureta

00:22:36.020 --> 00:22:43.810
The phrase repeats itself in my ears
making my heart ache

00:22:36.020 --> 00:22:43.810
Repeat suru phrase
mune ni setsu naku hibiku

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:44.220
Sensei will be back someday.

00:22:43.990 --> 00:22:51.910
It is the same season that we first met,
tHe memories are too vivid

00:22:43.990 --> 00:22:51.910
Degiri aeta kisetsu, azaya ka sugiru memory

00:22:45.840 --> 00:22:46.540
I know it.

00:22:51.020 --> 00:22:53.720
And as his true self next time.

00:22:51.910 --> 00:22:59.540
Even through hesitation and anxiety
I will never forget you

00:22:51.910 --> 00:22:59.540
Mayoi nayabu mirai mo, anata wo wasurenai

00:22:58.710 --> 00:23:00.490
Everything will be OK now.

00:23:00.610 --> 00:23:06.770
I will never forget you

00:23:00.610 --> 00:23:06.770
Anata wo wasurenai

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:24.300
I My Me Strawberry Eggs

00:23:15.940 --> 00:23:24.300
End of Class

00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:05.870
At the train station after school
that's where I look for you

00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:05.870
Hokago no eki kimi wo sagasu.

00:24:05.980 --> 00:24:15.230
With my racing heart
can I find you again today?

00:24:05.980 --> 00:24:15.230
Doki doki shiteru
kyo mo aeru kana?

00:24:30.400 --> 00:24:37.190
At this train station
I saw you many times before

00:24:30.400 --> 00:24:37.190
Eki no homu de
mikakete ta kimi.

00:24:37.350 --> 00:24:44.080
But couldn't talk to you
Not at all

00:24:37.350 --> 00:24:44.080
Hajime wa nanimo hanase nakatta.

00:24:44.230 --> 00:24:50.930
Will I find you again tomorrow?

00:24:44.230 --> 00:24:50.930
Moshimo ashita aetara iina?

00:24:51.070 --> 00:24:58.910
Maybe I'll have enough
courage to talk to you

00:24:51.070 --> 00:24:58.910
Youki dashite ieru kamone.

00:24:59.100 --> 00:25:06.040
Even if the sky cries

00:24:59.100 --> 00:25:06.040
Tatoeba sora ga namida shitemo...

00:25:06.040 --> 00:25:14.880
with your smile it's
a sunny day in my eyes

00:25:06.040 --> 00:25:14.880
kimi no egao de hitomi wa hareru yo.
